# FastAPI Fundamentals – Week 2

### 📚 Overview
This project covers **FastAPI basics**:
- Routers and modular structure  
- Dependency Injection  
- Request/Response models with Pydantic  
- Schema validation and error handling  

---

### 🏗 Project Structure
fastapi-bootstrap/
├─ app/
│ ├─ main.py
│ ├─ deps.py
│ ├─ errors.py
│ ├─ routers/sample.py
│ └─ schemas/sample.py
├─ tests/test_sample.py
├─ requirements.txt
├─ README.md

